      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Policy assistant\nLesson 4.4, the answering pipeline. Chat Trigger → AI Agent with one tool, search_policies: Supabase Vector Store in Retrieve Documents (As Tool for AI Agent) mode, limit 4, with the SAME embeddings model used for loading.\n\n**Credentials:** OpenAI (chat model and embeddings), Supabase.\n**Replace:** YOUR_MODEL.\n\nTest with the lesson's 8 questions. Q1 must say only the delivery fee is refunded, quoting the sentence; Q6 and Q7 must end with \"I'll ask Tolu\".",
